{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"mingdi-e-p033b","title":"刘康嗣山阳公","accounts":[{"id":"mingdi-e-p033b-account","label":"裴注·献帝传","text":"刘康嗣山阳公","evidence":["mingdi-e-p033b-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"mingdi-p0083","role":"嗣爵","evidence":["mingdi-e-p033b-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":234,"label":"青龙二年八月壬申","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"mingdi-y234","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"mingdi-q-o037","basis":"青龙二年八月壬申"},"evidence":["mingdi-e-p033b-q","mingdi-q-o037","mingdi-q-b-7a11c761ca65aeb3d195"]},"ordering_evidence":"mingdi-e-p033b-q","source_order":[3,267,"P033b"],"order":856}],"persons":[{"id":"mingdi-p0083","name":"刘康","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"mingdi-e-p033b-q","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-08c5dd7f2744c7eeea38","layer":"pei","quote":"八月壬申，葬于山阳国，陵曰禅陵，置园邑。葬之日，帝制锡衰弁绖，哭之恸。嫡孙桂氏乡侯康，嗣立为山阳公。”","attribution":"裴注·献帝传","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":266,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-577bfabc3a4642d33616","start":0,"end":51,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-b-7a11c761ca65aeb3d195","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-7a11c761ca65aeb3d195","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：青龙二年（公元 234）。己未：旧历初四日。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":252,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-6c0753fe684a18a3a281","start":0,"end":28,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-o037","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-ff97c2d326d0fc08a9de","layer":"original","quote":"二年春二月，（乙）〔己〕未〖1〗，太白犯荧惑。癸酉〖2〗，诏曰：“‘鞭作官刑〖3〗’，所以纠慢怠也〖4〗；而顷多以无辜死。其减鞭杖之制〖5〗，著于令。”三月，庚寅〖6〗，山阳公薨；帝素服发哀〖7〗，遣使持节，典护丧事。己酉〖8〗，大赦。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":249,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":118,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
